{"about_the_game":"It's just another one of these days. You're stuck inside the Machine: clicking buttons, pushing levers, hoping there is an end to all this.<br><br>Explore the Machine, understand what makes it tick, become a gear in its perfect system. Or maybe you want to get out?<br><br>Mechanisms<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/711a6b72dc0380e5336e5915a0760b80.poster.avif?t=1759496488\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/711a6b72dc0380e5336e5915a0760b80.webm?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/711a6b72dc0380e5336e5915a0760b80.mp4?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Interact with the modules of the Machine in an intuitive and tactile way. Repair broken mechanisms, upgrade, unlock and buy new ones.<br><br>Exponential Growth<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/d51daecf250b5a333cc9fd697453c081.poster.avif?t=1759496488\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/d51daecf250b5a333cc9fd697453c081.webm?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/d51daecf250b5a333cc9fd697453c081.mp4?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>What Machine takes, it gives back with interest. Experiment with the opportunities it presents and find lucrative synergies.<br><br>Discover secrets<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/801bc6928721bfcf6fec5e70d93ba8bc.poster.avif?t=1759496488\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/801bc6928721bfcf6fec5e70d93ba8bc.webm?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/801bc6928721bfcf6fec5e70d93ba8bc.mp4?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There's more to the Machine that meets the eye. Uncover its secrets, search for the hidden truth that lies beyond the cold exterior.<br><br>Relax<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/820aaa72e7bb120383af9c29791ef260.poster.avif?t=1759496488\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/820aaa72e7bb120383af9c29791ef260.webm?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/extras/820aaa72e7bb120383af9c29791ef260.mp4?t=1759496488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a break from your Sisyphean task. Tune out the ever present noise of the machinery and fill the silence with some chill music. Play a game or two, unwind but remember:<br><br>The Machine is waiting","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3023620?t=1759496488","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759496488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/16fa135511bf9ba94688cdddd54770f3fa16952f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759496488","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023620/16fa135511bf9ba94688cdddd54770f3fa16952f/capsul